  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mobile Learning Units make Rajasthan future ready</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In a world that has already shifted towards Artificial Intelligence, rural India is still struggling to provide basic computer education to its children. But not anymore! iPartner is engaging girls from the most marginalised communities from 27 villages of Rajasthan through a Mobile Learning Unit (MLU). Targeted primarily towards girls who are most vulnerable to commercial sexual exploitation, the MLU, which has multiple government-certified courses move every 3 months to a new village.</narrative>
  </description>
